        <title type="html"><![CDATA[Fix GainNode constructor options in advanced Web Audio guide]]></title>
        <id>https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/46112</id>
        <link href="https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/46112"/>
        <updated>2026-10-12T13:21:13.000Z</updated>
        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143878990?u=a497d43bf9f6bbe6c308a73145be33c540facb48&v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><h3 dir="auto">Description</h3>
<p dir="auto">Fix the <code class="notranslate">GainNode</code> constructor options in the Advanced Web Audio API guide to use <code class="notranslate">gain: 1</code> instead of <code class="notranslate">value: 1</code>.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Motivation</h3>
<p dir="auto">In the Web Audio API specification, the <code class="notranslate">GainOptions</code> dictionary accepts <code class="notranslate">gain</code> (float), not <code class="notranslate">value</code>. Passing <code class="notranslate">value: 1</code> has no effect because <code class="notranslate">value</code> is not a member of <code class="notranslate">GainOptions</code>. Using <code class="notranslate">gain: 1</code> correctly initializes the gain audio parameter matching the W3C specification and MDN's <code class="notranslate">GainNode()</code> constructor reference.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Reference: <a href="https://www.w3.org/TR/webaudio/#GainNode" rel="nofollow">Web Audio API Specification - GainOptions</a></li>
<li>Reference: <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/GainNode/GainNode" rel="nofollow">MDN GainNode() constructor reference</a></li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
<p dir="auto"><span class="issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se" aria-label="This pull request closes issue #46078.">Fixes</span> <a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="5781287902" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46078" data-hovercard-type="issue" data-hovercard-url="/mdn/content/issues/46078/hovercard" href="https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/46078">#46078</a></p>]]></content>
